{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: none. This is a prior-only Stan program; no top-level data variable appears on the left side of a sampling statement.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model-block priors so that `delta_factor1_tau` is sampled before it is used as the scale parameter in the prior for `delta_factor1_cp`. This is a same-density mechanical change because Stan sampling statements only add log-density terms and no data or likelihood terms were changed. The data file is unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> N;      // Number of observations

  // First factor information
  int<lower=0> N_factor1_levels;

  int<lower=0, upper=N_factor1_levels> L_factor1_ncp;
  array[L_factor1_ncp] int<lower=1, upper=N_factor1_levels> factor1_ncp_idx;

  int<lower=0, upper=N_factor1_levels> L_factor1_cp;
  array[L_factor1_cp] int<lower=1, upper=N_factor1_levels> factor1_cp_idx;

  // Second factor information
  int<lower=0> N_factor2_levels;

  // Third factor information
  int<lower=0> N_factor3_levels;

  // Nesting configuration
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=N_factor3_levels> obs_to_factor3;
  array[N_factor3_levels] int<lower=1, upper=N_factor2_levels> factor3_to_factor2;
  array[N_factor2_levels] int<lower=1, upper=N_factor1_levels> factor2_to_factor1;
}

parameters {
  // Baseline
  real baseline;

  // Hierarchical model for the first factor residuals
  vector[L_factor1_ncp] delta_factor1_ncp;
  vector[L_factor1_cp] delta_factor1_cp;
  real<lower=0> delta_factor1_tau;
}

transformed parameters {
  vector[N_factor1_levels] delta_factor1;

  vector[N_factor3_levels] log_psi;

  // Reconstruct first factor residuals
  delta_factor1[factor1_ncp_idx] = delta_factor1_tau * delta_factor1_ncp;
  delta_factor1[factor1_cp_idx] = delta_factor1_cp;

  log_psi =  baseline
           + delta_factor1[factor2_to_factor1[factor3_to_factor2]];
}

model {
  baseline ~ normal(0, 1);

  delta_factor1_tau ~ normal(0, 1);
  delta_factor1_cp ~ normal(0, delta_factor1_tau);
  delta_factor1_ncp ~ normal(0, 1);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"L_factor1_cp":1,"L_factor1_ncp":0,"N":2,"N_factor1_levels":1,"N_factor2_levels":2,"N_factor3_levels":2,"factor1_cp_idx":[1],"factor1_ncp_idx":[],"factor2_to_factor1":[1,1],"factor3_to_factor2":[2,1],"obs_to_factor3":[1,1]}","protected_variables":[]}
